SCOPE NOTICE

This license covers only the original code and documentation in this
repository: the HTML/CSS shell, the engine and scene modules under engine/, and
the parsing, extraction and verification tooling under tools/.

It does NOT cover, license, or grant any right to any third-party work, which
is deliberately absent from this repository and must be supplied by the user:

  - sound recordings and musical compositions (including any .mp3 / .wav),
  - MIDI transcriptions (any .mid / .midi),
  - song lyrics (any .lrc / text),
  - and anything generated from those works, which is ignored by .gitignore:
    data/*.js, tools/audio-analysis.json, tools/midi-notes.json,
    world-execute-me.html and any screenshot or capture of the animation.

Running this code produces derivative output from whatever audio, MIDI and
lyric files you provide. You are responsible for having the right to use those
files and any resulting output.
